  "components": [],
  "timeoriginalestimate": null,
  "description": {
   "type": "doc",
   "version": 1,
   "content": [
    {
     "type": "heading",
     "attrs": {
      "level": 3
     },
     "content": [
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "Description"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "paragraph",
     "content": [
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "The short \"Summary\" spreadsheet download of Sales By Representative leaves out four of the columns the report shows on screen: # Invoices, # Customers, Hrs Worked and Hrs Invoiced. It also adds a Totals row that this download is not supposed to have."
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "paragraph",
     "content": [
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "The figures are not missing from the report itself \u2014 only from the downloaded file."
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "heading",
     "attrs": {
      "level": 3
     },
     "content": [
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "Steps to reproduce"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "paragraph",
     "content": [
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "Environment: QA branch sv8582 (https://sv8582.qa.shopview.com). Desktop browser, signed in as an Admin."
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "orderedList",
     "attrs": {
      "order": 1
     },
     "content": [
      {
       "type": "listItem",
       "content": [
        {
         "type": "paragraph",
         "content": [
          {
           "type": "text",
           "text": "Open Reports, then Sales By Representative."
          }
         ]
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "type": "listItem",
       "content": [
        {
         "type": "paragraph",
         "content": [
          {
           "type": "text",
           "text": "Leave every control at its default: date range This Month, Product Type Parts & Service, All Statuses, All locations."
          }
         ]
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "type": "listItem",
       "content": [
        {
         "type": "paragraph",
         "content": [
          {
           "type": "text",
           "text": "Read the column headings on screen and note that # Invoices, # Customers, Hrs Worked and Hrs Invoiced are among them."
          }
         ]
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "type": "listItem",
       "content": [
        {
         "type": "paragraph",
         "content": [
          {
           "type": "text",
           "text": "Open the three-dot menu and choose the Summary CSV download."
          }
         ]
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "type": "listItem",
       "content": [
        {
         "type": "paragraph",
         "content": [
          {
           "type": "text",
           "text": "Open the downloaded file in a plain text editor, not a spreadsheet application, so the real first line is visible."
          }
         ]
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "type": "listItem",
       "content": [
        {
         "type": "paragraph",
         "content": [
          {
           "type": "text",
           "text": "Compare its heading row with what was read in step 3, then scroll to the bottom of the file and look for a Totals row."
          }
         ]
        }
       ]
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "heading",
     "attrs": {
      "level": 3
     },
     "content": [
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "Current behaviour"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "paragraph",
     "content": [
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "The Summary spreadsheet has ten columns, and this exact heading row read straight out of the file:"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "paragraph",
     "content": [
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "Representative,Location,\"Inv. Hrs\",\"Labor Invoiced\",\"Labor Margin\",\"Parts Invoiced\",\"Parts Margin\",Margin,\"Margin %\",Subtotal"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "paragraph",
     "content": [
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "# Invoices, # Customers, Hrs Worked and Hrs Invoiced are not in it. The file also ends with a Totals row."
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "paragraph",
     "content": [
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "The longer Expanded spreadsheet of the same report does contain Hrs Worked and Hrs Invoiced, so the figures reach the download code."
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "heading",
     "attrs": {
      "level": 3
     },
     "content": [
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "Expected behaviour"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "paragraph",
     "content": [
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "The Summary spreadsheet carries the same columns the Summary view shows on screen, including # Invoices, # Customers, Hrs Worked and Hrs Invoiced, and it has no Totals row."
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "rule"
    },
    {
     "type": "paragraph",
     "content": [
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "Source",
       "marks": [
        {
         "type": "strong"
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": " \u2014 "
      },
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "the "
      },
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "Sales By Representative report specification",
       "marks": [
        {
         "type": "link",
         "attrs": {
          "href": "https://shopview.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/~712020aa00b8d6a71f4259891982a304227c20/pages/585629698/SBR+Sales+By+Representative+Report"
         }
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": " on Confluence, version 17, requirement S14-R15: \u201cSummary CSV \u2014 file sales-by-representative-summary.csv, UTF-8 BOM, one header row + one row per rep in the current filtered view, in the currently-active order (S14-R2a). Headers, in order: Representative, # Invoices, # Customers, Hrs Worked, Hrs Invoiced, Inv. Hrs, Labor Invoiced, Labor Margin, Parts Invoiced, Parts Margin, Margin, Margin %, Subtotal.\u201d"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "paragraph",
     "content": [
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "Chris Ward confirmed the same thing in our questions spreadsheet",
       "marks": [
        {
         "type": "link",
         "attrs": {
          "href": "https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1x8cuYJlFsDHalVZZTh156_ZCq2gcOaGY/edit?usp=sharing&ouid=106388879401921597782&rtpof=true&sd=true"
         }
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": ": \u201con-screen should match download\u201d"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "paragraph",
     "content": [
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "That answer is from the tab \"The product vs your write-up\", row 9, on 5 August 2026. It agrees with the requirement above; nothing is being overridden."
      }
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
